# Case study HTML + dashboard linking

Applies in **template**, **Dutch**, and **Arcori**. Keep the three repos aligned.

## Every case study

- **HTML only** under `Documentation/`, filename matching `case-study` / `case_study` (`.html`).
- **No markdown** on the dashboard Case Study tab (`02_CASE_STUDY.md` / `03_CASE_STUDY.md` are not the Case Study surface).
- **Both sides are required** in the same file:
  - **Overview** — plain-language / employer story
  - **Technical** — architecture, APIs, stack decisions
- Required IDs (do not rename):
  - Tabs: `#btn-overview`, `#btn-technical`
  - Panels: `#version-overview`, `#version-technical`
- Expose `window.setCaseStudyVersion("overview"|"technical")` from the in-page switcher.
- Reuse the shared visual system (hero, pillars, `.version-switch`, dark green CSS vars / fonts).

```html
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<button id="btn-overview" data-version="overview">Overview</button>
<button id="btn-technical" data-version="technical">Technical</button>
<div id="version-overview" data-version-panel="overview">…</div>
<div id="version-technical" data-version-panel="technical" hidden>…</div>
```

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD — one version only, or MD-only case study -->
```

## Dashboard Case Study tab

- Discovery: `docs_discovery.discover_case_studies` — HTML whose name matches `case[_-]?study`.
- Sidebar sections **must** be Overview + Technical (`version-overview`, `version-technical`).
- Sidebar clicks **must drive the in-page tabs** via `docs.js` `applyCaseStudyVersion` → `setCaseStudyVersion` or `#btn-*` click. Reuse the existing iframe; do not recreate it per click.
- **Do not** rely on iframe `location.hash` alone (hash is dropped / ignored on load).
- After changing `docs.js`, bump `docs.js?v=docs-N` in `automation/dashboard/static/index.html`.

## Repo files

| Repo | Case study file |
|------|-----------------|
| Template | `case-study-codebase-template.html` + `case-study-ops-dashboard.html` |
| Dutch | `case-study-dutch-card-game.html` (product/stack; brief ops → template ops CS) |
| Arcori | `Documentation/01_Active_Plans/case-study-*.html` (create HTML if only markdown exists) |

Wiring: `automation/dashboard/static/docs.js`, `docs_discovery.py`. When you fix linking, copy `docs.js` to all three repos.
